This addon is a new Java client overlay and bounded breadth-first solver.
The upstream website is not bundled; its JavaScript, screenshots and font
are not embedded. Native icons are rendered by the already-installed TFC.
This addon is provided under AGPL-3.0-only; see LICENSE.
Minecraft, Forge, TerraFirmaCraft and TerraFirmaGreg are not bundled.
Keeping a build local/private does not remove its license obligations if
it is later distributed. No public repository or release was created.
